WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.060
Does the trading software keep piling all of your savings onto an exchange forever?

2
00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:05.243
No.

3
00:00:05.243 --> 00:00:10.547
Think of it like a cash register that keeps only up to $25,000 working in the drawer so

4
00:00:10.547 --> 00:00:13.656
orders stay nimble and never crowd smaller markets.
